# Cursor Rules for VitaStress Stress Prediction Project

## Project Overview
This is a research project for predicting stress/anxiety 5-10 minutes ahead using multimodal physiological signals from the VitaStress wearable dataset. The project investigates optimal window sizes (RQ1), feature importance (RQ2), and model architectures (RQ3) for proactive stress detection.

