## Research Questions Checklist

### RQ1: Window Size Optimization
- [ ] Systematically test: 30s, 60s, 90s, 120s, 150s, 180s
- [ ] Plot accuracy vs. latency trade-off curves
- [ ] Report time-to-warning for each window size
- [ ] Use same features across all window sizes for fair comparison

### RQ2: Feature Importance
- [ ] Permutation importance on best-performing model
- [ ] SHAP values for tree-based models (XGBoost)
- [ ] Attention weights for Transformer models
- [ ] Ablation studies: remove modality groups systematically
  - Without EDA
  - Without HR/HRV
  - Without accelerometer
  - Without respiration
  - Activity features only (baseline)

### RQ3: Model Architecture Comparison
- [ ] Train all architectures with identical preprocessing
- [ ] Compare: LogReg, RF, XGBoost, 1D CNN, LSTM, GRU, Transformer
- [ ] Report training time, inference speed, model size
- [ ] Statistical significance tests (McNemar's test, paired t-test)
- [ ] Identify best architecture for deployment

