## When Stuck

### Data Quality Issues
- Check `vitastress_draft.ipynb` for similar examples
- Verify zero-as-missing corrections are applied
- Check quality flags (`bpm_q`, `resp_q`, etc.)
- Visualize distributions (outliers often obvious in plots)

### Feature Extraction Issues
- Start with simple features (mean, std) before complex ones
- Test on single subject first, then scale to all subjects
- Use TSFEL documentation: https://tsfel.readthedocs.io/
- Check for NaN propagation (one NaN → all features NaN)

### Model Training Issues
- Start with smallest model (LogReg) to verify pipeline
- Check label distribution (extreme imbalance?)
- Verify train/test split (no data leakage?)
- Monitor training curves (loss, accuracy over epochs)

### Performance Issues
- Use batching for large datasets
- Cache intermediate results (e.g., resampled signals)
- Profile code to identify bottlenecks
- Consider downsampling for prototyping (test on 5 subjects first)

